{
 "plan": {
  "title": "Child Improvement Dashboard",
  "subtitle": "Tracking progress from baseline to endline assessments.",
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Total Children",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS n FROM baseline",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Average Shuttle Run Improvement by Location",
    "sql": "SELECT T1.\"Location\", SUM(T2.\"Shuttle run sec\" - T1.\"Shuttle run sec\") AS shuttle_run_improvement FROM baseline T1 INNER JOIN endline T2 ON T1.\"Child ID\" = T2.\"Child ID\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 20",
    "x": "Location",
    "y": [
     "shuttle_run_improvement"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Average Sit Ups Improvement by Coach",
    "sql": "SELECT T1.\"Coach\", SUM(T2.\"Sit ups\" - T1.\"Sit ups\") AS sit_ups_improvement FROM baseline T1 INNER JOIN endline T2 ON T1.\"Child ID\" = T2.\"Child ID\" GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 20",
    "x": "Coach",
    "y": [
     "sit_ups_improvement"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "Top 10 Shuttle Run Improvements",
    "sql": "SELECT T1.\"Child name\", T1.\"Location\", T1.\"Coach\", (T2.\"Shuttle run sec\" - T1.\"Shuttle run sec\") AS shuttle_run_improvement FROM baseline T1 INNER JOIN endline T2 ON T1.\"Child ID\" = T2.\"Child ID\" ORDER BY shuttle_run_improvement DESC LIMIT 10"
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "This dashboard provides a snapshot of the children's progress between the baseline and endline assessments. The total number of children participating is {{p1}}. The bar charts highlight the average improvement in shuttle run time and sit-ups, grouped by location and coach respectively.  The top 10 shuttle run improvements are displayed in a table, showcasing the most significant gains.  Further analysis could explore the factors contributing to these improvements, such as coaching styles or location-specific training programs."
 },
